#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:5
msgid "Create nomenclature"
msgstr "创建名称"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:7
msgid ""
"A `project`_ is a combination / assembly of `elements`_ / components, "
"QElectroTech provides the feature to create a nomenclature, also known as "
"Bill Of Materials (BOM), which shows the information about the different "
"`elements`_ / components. QElectroTech allows creating the nomenclature "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"A`项目 <project_>`_ 是 `元件 <elements_>`_/组件的组合/组装，QElectroTech提供了创建名称的功能，又称Bill"
" Of Materials(BOM),它显示了不同 `元件 <elements_>`_/组件的信息。QEctroTech允许自动创建名称。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:18
msgid "To create a project nomenclature:"
msgstr "要创建项目名称："

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:20
msgid "Activate the folio where the nomenclature table has to be created."
msgstr "激活必须创建名称表的框。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:21
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Add a nomenclature** to display the configuration PopUp "
"window of the nomenclature creator."
msgstr "选择 **项目 > 添加一个名称** 以显示名称创建者的配置弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:26
#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:36
#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:57
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:29
msgid "Go to **Display** tab to define display table properties."
msgstr "转到 **Display** 标签，以定义显示表属性 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:30
msgid "Define the **Table name** which will identify the table."
msgstr "定义将标明表格的 **表名称**。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:31
msgid ""
"Configure the display table settings (header and table cells properties, "
"auto adjustment of table size, etc.)."
msgstr "配置显示表设置(标题和表格单元格属性，表格大小的自动调整等)."

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:39
msgid "Go to **Content** tab to define table columns."
msgstr "转到 **Content** 标签来定义表格列 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:40
msgid ""
"Modify the list of information to be displayed according the commands of the"
" following table."
msgstr "根据下表的命令修改要显示的信息列表。"

