#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:62
msgid ""
"The content request configuration can be saved and chosen from "
"**Configuration** section to increase working efficiency."
msgstr "内容请求配置可以从 **配置** 部分保存和选择，以提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:64
msgid ""
"QElectroTech is working with SQLite database, nomenclature table content can"
" also be defined by SQL query."
msgstr "QElectroTech正与SQLite数据库合作，术语表内容也可以通过SQL查询来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:66
msgid ""
"Define the filtering parameters (**Filter by** and type of `elements`_)."
msgstr "定义过滤参数( E)**过滤器由** 类型 `元件 <elements_>`_)."

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once the desired configuration is defined, press **OK** to create "
"nomenclature tables."
msgstr "一旦定义了所需的配置，请按 **OK** 创建术语表。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/create_nomenclature.rst:71
msgid ""
"The project nomenclature can be created, modified and updated at any time."
msgstr "项目名称可随时创建、修改和更新。"
